    <!-- Privacy Policy -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy &amp; Data Security</string>
    <string name="privacy_badge_title">100% On-Device Guarantee</string>
    <string name="privacy_badge_desc">Banknote scans are analyzed strictly on your local device. Images are never transmitted or stored on remote servers.</string>
    <string name="privacy_view_policy_btn">Read Full Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_heading">Privacy Policy &amp; Security Overview</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_intro">CurrencyGuard AI is designed with strict privacy-by-design architecture. We believe sensitive financial and physical banknote imagery belongs exclusively on your personal device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_title">1. On-Device AI Processing</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_desc">All deep learning visual classification, ML Kit OCR character recognition, and security thread/watermark analysis execute 100% locally on your hardware. Images are discarded immediately from memory after feature extraction.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_title">2. Camera &amp; File Permissions</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_desc">Camera permission is used solely for the live camera viewfinder during banknote alignment. Storage access is utilized only when you choose to import an existing photo or save an exported PDF report.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_title">3. Local Scan Database</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_desc">Screening logs and confidence metrics are saved in an internal SQLite Room database stored in the application private sandbox. No telemetry or analytics are collected.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4_title">4. Generative AI Explanations</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4_desc">When using optional Google AI Studio Gemini explanations, only anonymized textual feature tokens are submitted. Full banknote photos are NEVER transmitted over the network.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_5_title">5. Data Deletion &amp; Control</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_5_desc">You retain unilateral ownership of your data. You can delete all stored scan records and cached data at any time from the Settings menu.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_6_title">6. Non-Banking Legal Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_6_desc">CurrencyGuard AI is an automated screening assistant for preliminary risk assessment and educational purposes. It does not provide legal, judicial, or central bank counterfeit certification.</string>
